### 2. Evidence Graph & Provenance Contract

#### [NEW] [backend/app/schemas/evidence_provenance.py](file:///c:/Users/adity/OneDrive/Desktop/SIH26079-RII/backend/app/schemas/evidence_provenance.py)
- **Evidence Graph**:
  - `EvidenceNode`: Node types (`ENSEMBLE_SPREAD`, `RUN_TO_RUN_DRIFT`, `SYNOPTIC_REGIME`, `FAILURE_MEMORY_ANALOG`, `CLIMATOLOGY_DEPARTURE`) with physical quantities and confidence scores.
  - `EvidenceEdge`: Relationship types (`SUPPORTS`, `CONTRADICTS`, `AMPLIFIES`, `ATTENUATES`) with normalized weights in $[-1.0, 1.0]$.
  - `EvidenceGraph`: Directed graph representation linking atmospheric state signals to the predicted bust probability.
- **Cryptographic Provenance**:
  - `ModelProvenance`: Git commit SHA, model artifact SHA-256, calibrator SHA-256, feature schema SHA-256.
  - `DataProvenance`: Upstream provider, cycle timestamp, dissemination latency, ingestion status.
  - `VerificationProvenance`: Execution environment, runtime dependencies, execution timestamp.

