### 3. Failure Memory Engine & Retrieval API

#### [NEW] [backend/app/builder2/failure_memory.py](file:///c:/Users/adity/OneDrive/Desktop/SIH26079-RII/backend/app/builder2/failure_memory.py)
Implements Blueprint Section 6.1:
- `FailureEpisode`: Storage schema for historical forecast failure episodes (`episode_id`, `hazard_family`, `issue_time`, `location`, `lead_hours`, `forecast_error`, `severity`, `motif_id`, `state_vector`).
- `FailureMemoryStore`: In-memory and disk-persisted vector/feature store of historical failures.
- `retrieve_failure_analogs()`: Issue-time-safe nearest neighbor retrieval filtered by hazard, lead horizon, season, and atmospheric regime with sample count and uncertainty estimates.

