### 4. Benchmark Ladder Runner & Cycle-Block Bootstrap Evaluator

#### [NEW] [configs/benchmark_ladder.yaml](file:///c:/Users/adity/OneDrive/Desktop/SIH26079-RII/configs/benchmark_ladder.yaml)
Configuration defining:
- Evaluation dataset and test split (2024-07-01 to 2024-12-31).
- 7 ladder tiers: Climatology, Persistence, Raw Spread, Spread Logistic Regression, Compact Statistical Model, V3 Incumbent, Calibrated V3.
- Bootstrap configuration: 1000 iterations, cycle-block resampling, seed 42.

#### [NEW] [scripts/run_benchmark_ladder.py](file:///c:/Users/adity/OneDrive/Desktop/SIH26079-RII/scripts/run_benchmark_ladder.py)
Executable CLI script:
- Loads test dataset and evaluates all 7 ladder tiers.
- Computes PR-AUC, Brier score, Brier Skill Score (BSS), ECE, and CRPS.
- Runs cycle-block bootstrap to compute 95% confidence intervals for each metric.
- Generates machine-readable results (`data/evaluation/benchmark_ladder_results.json`) and formatted terminal summary table.

